// ===== v75：丟雞蛋（拋物線、蛋殼蛋液殘留 12 小時）、不理性行為（偷襲／衝撞／丟蛋）、逮捕與拘留、回應陳情（行政學）、
//        宮中太監與流放、動物毛髮、城外現代化（路燈、拉麵攤、作物田）、樹木與燈柱實體化 =====
var V75={eg:[],sh:[],irrT:3,petT:0,exEU:null,furP:null};
function gHr(){return G.day*24+G.hr;}
// ---------- 丟雞蛋 ----------
function throwEgg(from,to,who,tgt){var dx=to[0]-from[0],dz=to[2]-from[2],d=Math.hypot(dx,dz),T=0.35+d/11,g=9.8,vy=(to[1]-from[1]+0.5*g*T*T)/T;
  V75.eg.push({p:from.slice(),v:[dx/T,vy,dz/T],t:0,T:T,who:who,tgt:tgt,r:Math.random()*6});if(typeof smp==='function')smp('pick',0.25,1.5);}
function eggSplat(p,wall,hitWho){var y=wall?p[1]:gY(p[0],p[2])+0.004,now=gHr();G.eggs=G.eggs||[];
  G.eggs.push([+p[0].toFixed(3),+y.toFixed(3),+p[2].toFixed(3),+now.toFixed(2),0,Math.random()*6.28,0.07+Math.random()*0.04,wall?wall[0]:0,wall?wall[1]:0]);
  for(var i=0;i<7;i++){var a=Math.random()*6.28,s=0.6+Math.random()*1.4;V75.sh.push({p:[p[0],wall?p[1]:y+0.02,p[2]],v:[Math.cos(a)*s+(wall?wall[0]*1.5:0),0.8+Math.random()*1.6,Math.sin(a)*s+(wall?wall[1]*1.5:0)],t:0,r:Math.random()*6});}
  if(typeof puff==='function')for(var k=0;k<6;k++)puff([p[0],(wall?p[1]:y)+0.05,p[2]],[(Math.random()-0.5)*0.8,0.5+Math.random()*0.6,(Math.random()-0.5)*0.8],{s:0.05,gr:0.6,life:0.45,a:0.8,c:k%2?[1,0.82,0.2]:[1,0.97,0.85],dr:0});
  if(typeof smp==='function'){smp('drop',0.55,1.7);smp('chop',0.3,2.1);}while(G.eggs.length>80)G.eggs.shift();
  if(hitWho&&typeof bubble==='function')bubble(hitWho,hitWho===PL?'……':['哎喲！','誰丟的！','好臭！'][Math.floor(Math.random()*3)],1500,'bad');}
function eggUpdate(dt){var now=gHr();if(G.eggs&&G.eggs.length&&now-G.eggs[0][3]>72)G.eggs=G.eggs.filter(function(e){return now-e[3]<=72;});   // v117：保留三天（72 小時）後清乾淨
  V75.eg=V75.eg.filter(function(e){e.t+=dt;e.v[1]-=9.8*dt;e.p[0]+=e.v[0]*dt;e.p[1]+=e.v[1]*dt;e.p[2]+=e.v[2]*dt;e.r+=dt*9;var gy=gY(e.p[0],e.p[2]),T=e.tgt;
    if(T&&T.k==='gate'){if(Math.hypot(e.p[0]-T.p[0],e.p[2]-T.p[2])<0.32&&e.p[1]<3.2){eggSplat(e.p,T.n);return false;}}
    else if(T&&T.o){var o=T.o,ox=o.p?o.p[0]:o.pos[0],oz=o.p?o.p[1]:o.pos[2],oy=o.p?gY(ox,oz):(o.y||0);if(Math.hypot(e.p[0]-ox,e.p[2]-oz)<0.36&&e.p[1]>oy&&e.p[1]<oy+1.85){eggSplat([ox+(Math.random()-0.5)*0.3,0,oz+(Math.random()-0.5)*0.3],null,o);if(o===PL)eggOnPL(e.who);return false;}}
    if(e.p[1]<=gy){eggSplat(e.p);return false;}return e.t<4;});
  V75.sh=V75.sh.filter(function(s){s.t+=dt;if(s.v){s.v[1]-=9.8*dt;s.p[0]+=s.v[0]*dt;s.p[1]+=s.v[1]*dt;s.p[2]+=s.v[2]*dt;var gy=gY(s.p[0],s.p[2])+0.003;if(s.p[1]<gy){s.p[1]=gy;s.v[1]*=-0.25;s.v[0]*=0.4;s.v[2]*=0.4;if(Math.abs(s.v[1])<0.3){G.eggs.push([+s.p[0].toFixed(3),+gy.toFixed(3),+s.p[2].toFixed(3),+gHr().toFixed(2),1,s.r,0.012,0,0]);return false;}}}return s.t<3;});}
function eggOnPL(who){toast('🥚 皇上被雞蛋砸中了！',2000);if(typeof camShake==='function')camShake(0.12);if(!who||who.k==='mon')return;
  var cop=ST.cop.filter(function(c){return !c.hide&&c.c&&c.c.st>0;})[0];if(!cop&&!(who===V75.exEU)){bubble(EU,'來人啊！有刁民對皇上丟雞蛋！巡捕都上哪兒去了……',2600,'eu');return;}
  setTimeout(function(){jailAdd(who,2,'對皇上丟雞蛋');if(cop)bubble(cop,'大膽刁民！帶回巡捕房拘留兩天！',2400);},900);}
function eggDraw(u,depth){if(depth||!MK2.cyl)return;var now=gHr();(G.eggs||[]).forEach(function(e){var age=now-e[3],k=Math.max(0.35,1-age/14);
    if(e[4]===1){bx(u,0,[0.95*k+0.05,0.93*k+0.05,0.86*k+0.05],[e[0],e[1],e[2]],[0.014,0.003,0.01],e[5]);return;}
    if(e[7]||e[8]){var yw=Math.atan2(e[7],e[8]);bx(u,0,[0.98*k,0.9*k,0.6*k],[e[0]+e[7]*0.21,e[1],e[2]+e[8]*0.21],[e[6]*2.2,e[6]*2.6,0.006],yw);bx(u,0,[1*k,0.68*k,0.08*k],[e[0]+e[7]*0.215,e[1]-0.02,e[2]+e[8]*0.215],[e[6]*0.8,e[6]*0.8,0.006],yw);return;}
    bx(u,0,[0.95*k,0.9*k,0.62*k],[e[0],e[1],e[2]],[e[6]*1.6,0.003,e[6]*1.25],e[5],MK2.cyl);bx(u,0,[1*k,0.66*k,0.06*k],[e[0]+0.01,e[1]+0.003,e[2]],[e[6]*0.42,0.006,e[6]*0.4],e[5],MK2.cyl);});
  V75.eg.forEach(function(e){bx(u,depth,[0.96,0.92,0.82],e.p,[0.022,0.03,0.022],e.r,MK2.sph);});V75.sh.forEach(function(s){bx(u,depth,[0.96,0.94,0.88],s.p,[0.014,0.004,0.01],s.r);});}
// ---------- 不理性行為：偷襲、衝撞、丟雞蛋 ----------
function irrTargets(actor,forPL){var L=[];if(forPL||actor===V75.exEU){L.push({k:'pl',o:PL});return L;}
  [-1,1].forEach(function(s){var p=roadPt(GATE_S,s*2.2),u=stU(),n=[-u[1],u[0]];L.push({k:'gate',p:[p[0],1.4+Math.random()*1.2,p[1]],n:[u[0],u[1]]});});
  ST.cop.forEach(function(c){if(!c.hide)L.push({k:'cop',o:c});});if(EU&&!EU.hidden&&!inCap(EU.pos[0],EU.pos[2]))L.push({k:'eu',o:EU});return L;}
function tPos(T){if(T.p)return T.p;var o=T.o;return o.p?[o.p[0],gY(o.p[0],o.p[1])+1.2,o.p[1]]:[o.pos[0],(o.y||0)+1.25,o.pos[2]];}
function irrStart(n,forPL){var L=irrTargets(n,forPL);if(!L.length)return;var T=L[Math.floor(Math.random()*L.length)],r=Math.random(),k=T.k==='gate'||r<0.55?'egg':r<0.8?'ram':'sneak';
  n.irr={k:k,T:T,t:0,ph:0};if(Math.random()<0.6)bubble(n,{egg:['吃我一蛋！','狗官！','看蛋！'],ram:['讓開！','衝啊——'],sneak:['……','嘿嘿……']}[k][Math.floor(Math.random()*(k==='ram'?2:3))],1400,'bad');}
function knock(o,from,dist){var x=o.p?o.p[0]:o.pos[0],z=o.p?o.p[1]:o.pos[2],dx=x-from[0],dz=z-from[1],d=Math.hypot(dx,dz)||1;if(o.p){o.p[0]+=dx/d*dist;o.p[1]+=dz/d*dist;}else{o.pos[0]+=dx/d*dist;o.pos[2]+=dz/d*dist;}
  if(o===PL){if(typeof camShake==='function')camShake(0.25);toast('⚠ 有人衝撞聖駕！',1600);}else if(o.A&&o.A.anims&&o.A.anims.hit){o.once='hit';o.play('hit',0.1);o.t=0;}else if(o.p){o.clip='hit';o.t=0;o.stun=0.6;}
  if(o.c)o.c.st=Math.max(0,o.c.st-10);}
function irrStep(n,dt){var I=n.irr,T=I.T,tp=tPos(T),d=Math.hypot(tp[0]-n.p[0],tp[2]-n.p[1]);I.t+=dt;if(I.t>14||(T.o&&T.o.hide)){n.irr=null;return 'idle';}
  if(I.k==='egg'){if(I.ph===0){if(d>5.95){npcGo(n,tp[0],tp[2],dt,1.6,0.3);return 'idle';}if(d<2.8){var bk=[n.p[0]-(tp[0]-n.p[0])/d*3,n.p[1]-(tp[2]-n.p[1])/d*3];npcGo(n,bk[0],bk[1],dt,1.4,0.3);return 'idle';}I.ph=1;I.t2=0;n.sp=0;}
    npcFace(n,tp[0],tp[2],dt);I.t2+=dt;if(I.ph===1&&I.t2>0.45){I.ph=2;throwEgg([n.p[0]+Math.sin(n.yaw)*0.3,gY(n.p[0],n.p[1])+1.6,n.p[1]+Math.cos(n.yaw)*0.3],tp,n,T);}if(I.t2>1.3){n.irr=null;n.tg=null;}return 'throw';}
  var spd=I.k==='ram'?3.4:1.1,stop=I.k==='ram'?0.75:0.85;if(I.k==='sneak'&&d<3)spd=2.6;
  if(npcGo(n,tp[0],tp[2],dt,spd,stop)){knock(T.o,[n.p[0],n.p[1]],I.k==='ram'?1.3:0.8);if(T.k!=='pl'&&T.o.c)bubble(T.o,['大膽！','哪來的刁民！'][Math.floor(Math.random()*2)],1400);else if(T.k==='eu')bubble(EU,'哎喲！反了反了！',1600,'eu');
    if(T.k==='pl'&&n.k==='res'&&ST.cop.some(function(c){return !c.hide;}))setTimeout(function(){jailAdd(n,2,'衝撞聖駕');},800);n.irr=null;n.tg=mktPt();return I.k==='ram'?'hit':'slash';}
  return 'idle';}
function irrUpdate(dt){var M=stMood(),day=stDay();V75.irrT-=dt;
  if(V75.irrT<=0&&!UI.locked){var bad=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(8-M.score)/40));V75.irrT=Math.max(4,22-bad*16)+Math.random()*6;
    var pool=(day?ST.npc.filter(function(n){return !n.hide&&n.st!=='home'&&!n.irr&&near(n,26);}):ST.mon.filter(function(m){return !m.hide&&!m.flee&&!m.irr&&near(m,26);}));
    if(pool.length&&Math.random()<0.35+bad*0.6){var n=pool[Math.floor(Math.random()*pool.length)];irrStart(n,Math.random()<0.1);}}
  ST.npc.concat(ST.mon).forEach(function(n){if(n.irr&&!n.hide){var a=irrStep(n,dt);npcAnim(n,dt,a);}});}
// ---------- 逮捕與拘留 ----------
function jailAdd(n,days,why){if(!n||n.jailed)return;n.jailed=1;G.jail=G.jail||[];G.jail.push({m:n.m,n:n.n,why:why,until:days>0?G.day+days:-1,ex:n===V75.exEU?1:0});saveG();
  var i=ST.npc.indexOf(n);if(i>=0)ST.npc.splice(i,1);n.hide=true;if(n===V75.exEU)V75.exEU.hide=true;toast('⛓ '+n.n+'被押到巡捕房拘留'+(days>0?days+'天':'，等皇上發落')+'。',2400);}
function jailTick(){if(!G.jail)return;var out=G.jail.filter(function(j){return j.until>=0&&G.day>=j.until;});if(out.length){G.jail=G.jail.filter(function(j){return out.indexOf(j)<0;});saveG();out.forEach(function(j){if(j.ex&&V75.exEU)V75.exEU.hide=false;});}}
function jailHTML(){var L=G.jail||[];return '<h3>⛓ 拘留中（'+L.length+'）</h3>'+(L.length?'<div class="shList">'+L.map(function(j,i){return '<div class="shIt">'+thumbH('b:'+j.m)+'<b>'+esc(j.n)+'</b><small>'+esc(j.why)+'・'+(j.until>=0?'第'+(j.until+1)+'天放人':'等皇上發落')+'</small><button class="b2" data-rel="'+i+'">釋放</button></div>';}).join('')+'</div>':'<p class="sub">目前沒有人被拘留。</p>');}
